 "chopper_bespoke": {
  "about": "Bespoke machined chopper parts, approved by beenster 17 Nov ('fantastic, perfect'). Built by foundry/chopper_parts3d.py; a model asks with detail.bespoke {\"pegs\": [design, metal], \"covers\": [...], \"lamps\": [...], \"engine\": [...]}. Every design comes in every metal. Added 17 Nov: show sissy bars (detail.sissy chain/scroll/filigree with detail.sissy_metal) and billet wheels (a model wheel's style and finish; finishes chrome, steel_brushed, gold_bright, brass). Every wheel style passes the spoke-to-rim check (python3 foundry/wheels3d.py --check).",
